00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.570
This song...

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:26.650
<i>Shredded memories will give you limitless wings</i>

00:19:26.650 --> 00:19:33.100
<i>How we talked that day... How we'd always laugh...</i>

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:40.650
