00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:44.810
Freyja!

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:48.430
<i>Are you, are you there?</i>

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:53.540
<i>Let us blaze through the battlefield we live</i>

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:57.700
